  "ruleText": "Agr 2209.01 Grower’s Declaration. A grower's declaration shall be a statement signed by the grower giving, for any lot of seed, the lot number, the kind, variety, origin and weight.\n\nSource. #5083, eff 2-26-91; EXPIRED: 2-26-97\n\nNew. #6495, eff 4-23-97, EXPIRED: 4-23-05\n\nNew. #12469, INTERIM, eff 1-26-18, EXPIRES: 7-25-18; ss by #12576, eff 7-21-18",
